#var, use "command >Rest Client: Switch Environment" in search bar of vs code
@id=1
@projectId=1
@sessionId=1

###

### Get all documents
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/documents?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get document by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/documents/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new document
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/documents HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "DOC-2023-001",
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "students": "Juan Pérez, María Gómez",
  "careerName": "Ingeniería de Sistemas",
  "commissionName": "Comisión A",
  "coordinatorName": "Dr. Carlos Rodriguez",
  "regionalCenterName": "Centro Regional Norte",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### Update an existing document
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/documents/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "DOC-2023-001-UPDATED",
  "students": "Juan Pérez, María Gómez, Pedro Sánchez",
  "careerName": "Ingeniería de Sistemas",
  "commissionName": "Comisión B",
  "coordinatorName": "Dra. Ana Martinez",
  "regionalCenterName": "Centro Regional Norte",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### Delete a document
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/documents/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json